WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.334
♪ (PLAYING PIANO) ♪

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.169
Oh, yeah.
I got some sound now.

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:04.370
One, two.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:07.774
HOWARD STERN: Bruce Springsteen
is a few inches away from me.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.308
And I am-- I'm starstruck.

00:00:09.441 --> 00:00:10.443
(LAUGHS)

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:11.577
STERN: We have
so many questions,

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.345
-so let me just dive in.
-Sounds great.

00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:15.648
I love what you say
about your dad.

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:17.216
-Boy, do I relate to that.
-Yeah.

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:19.953
It was tough. My role model,
my father, was not giving.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.088
♪<i> I was born blue
 And weathered ♪</i>

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:24.357
All I knew is,
I am his agent in the world,

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.060
and I'm going to make something
out of your story.

00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:32.098
A lot of my work,
if not most of it,

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:33.799
that's the root of it.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.202
♪ (STRUMMING GUITAR) ♪

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.707
STERN: So, you're sitting there
with Clarence.

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:43.108
-Yeah.
-STERN: Do I have it right?

00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:45.011
You were sitting
and strumming the guitar?

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.379
That was tough.
I had a feeling he could hear me

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:49.248
because he could squeeze
your hand.

00:00:49.581 --> 00:00:51.484
So I just played this song.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.553
♪<i> Oh, meet me</i> ♪

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:59.492
♪<i> In a land of hope
 And dreams</i> ♪

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:01.727
STERN: Beautiful song.

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:03.530
It's-- Yeah, it's a hymn.

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:06.832
You have any tricks
in songwriting?

00:01:06.932 --> 00:01:08.701
First thing you want
is a good metaphor.

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:11.104
♪ (PLAYING PIANO) ♪

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:14.040
I'm playing and I'm singing,
but I'm listening too.

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:20.213
If I'm creating that sensation
for me,

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:21.815
I know I'm creating it for you.

00:01:23.248 --> 00:01:25.785
♪<i> Oh, Thunder Road ♪</i>

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:28.988
<i> ♪ Sit tight, take hold ♪</i>

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:31.157
<i> ♪ Thunder Road ♪</i>

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:35.828
Finally got me to cry
on the air.

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:37.030
It's the first time ever.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.098
-(CHUCKLES)
-STERN: Wow.

